        "notes": "File verbatim except adaln_cache_dir (a local path). sage_attn2 needs SageAttention with thu-ml/SageAttention@d9704247 on SM90: PyPI 2.2.0 returns uninitialised output there, and a venv with sageattention 1.x silently falls back to SA1 (2xH200, 2026-10-30)."
