        "serve_args": "--ulysses-degree 2 --model-variant fl2va --performance-mode speed --minimax-h3-adaln-cache-path /scratch/bench/sgl-adaln/fl2va-t2va-29.safetensors",
        "notes": "Matches the source's AdaLN cache. The sidecar is built for this exact schedule; the cookbook documents it on 4 GPUs (TP2 + Ulysses 2), here on the verbatim 2-GPU topology."
