        "serve_args": "--ulysses-degree 2 --model-variant fl2va --performance-mode speed --minimax-h3-adaln-cache-path /scratch/bench/sgl-adaln/fl2va-t2va-29.safetensors --attention-backend sage_attn",
        "notes": "Matches both of the source's lossy features. Needs SageAttention with the SM90 fix (thu-ml/SageAttention@d9704247) in the sglang env; without it sglang warns and falls back to FA."
